        "tree_id": "d78a3ee52d256f687add594692429074347d7130",
        "message": "docs(gate-p1): record the Director signature and grant tier S1\n\nThe Director signed GATE:P1 with the verbatim answer \"Oui, signe S1\" after the\ndossier, the local gates and the 8/8 Actions runs were presented. This commit\ntranscribes the decision; the agent claims no part of the grant.\n\nauthorized_tier S0 -> S1. current_tier stays S0: validate-blueprint B6 computes a\ngrant as current+1 for a gate without a tier field, so raising both would read as\nan S1->S1 grant and fail. GATES.yaml regenerated (source sha only).\n\nS1 authorizes NET-001..006, PR-N1..N4, SEC-001, NG-001. It does not pass NET-GATE:\nart stays forbidden (I2), and AI-001/AI-002 still need GATE:P2 + the P0-006 whitelist.\n\nEvidence: docs/state/evidence/20261118T074117Z-GATE-P1/ (blueprint 0 errors,\nart-bible 0 art tasks in authorization, concept 0, docs 0, verify 17/17).\n\nAgent: orchestrator\nTask: GATE:P1",
